WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.628
"Ha-ha!" Jack laughed loudly at the man.

2
00:00:10.629 --> 00:00:16.319
"Five little beans for one big cow?"

3
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.900
The man nodded and grinned.

4
00:00:18.901 --> 00:00:27.258
"How about it, Jack?" he asked.

5
00:00:27.259 --> 00:00:29.869
Jack shook his head.

6
00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:32.263
"That's not a good deal.

7
00:00:32.264 --> 00:00:37.593
I won't trade my cow for five little beans!"

8
00:00:37.594 --> 00:00:42.122
The man shrugged. "Oh well.

9
00:00:42.123 --> 00:00:45.560
These beans are little.

10
00:00:45.561 --> 00:00:49.367
But they are magic."

11
00:00:49.368 --> 00:01:04.362
He began to walk away.

12
00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:14.050
"Wait!" Jack called. "Did you say magic beans?"

13
00:01:14.051 --> 00:01:17.448
"Yes." The man came back.

14
00:01:17.449 --> 00:01:22.421
He held out the beans again.

15
00:01:22.422 --> 00:01:27.267
"I don’t know . . . ," Jack said slowly.

16
00:01:27.268 --> 00:01:32.125
He stared at the beans.

17
00:01:32.126 --> 00:01:35.013
Then he looked at Milky White.

18
00:01:35.014 --> 00:01:40.236
"We need to sell Milky White for money," Jack said.

19
00:01:40.237 --> 00:01:46.782
"If I trade her for beans, Mother will be—"

20
00:01:46.783 --> 00:01:51.148
"You can plant these beans," the man said.

21
00:01:51.149 --> 00:01:56.237
"They will grow through the clouds, up to the sky!"

22
00:01:56.238 --> 00:02:00.137
"Hmm," Jack thought.

23
00:02:00.138 --> 00:02:06.560
"A beanstalk as high as the sky?

24
00:02:06.561 --> 00:02:15.435
That sounds interesting."

25
00:02:15.436 --> 00:02:19.753
"Here." The man put the beans in Jack's hand.

26
00:02:19.754 --> 00:02:23.170
"Just take the beans and plant them.

27
00:02:23.171 --> 00:02:37.492
If nothing happens, I'll give back your cow."

28
00:02:37.493 --> 00:02:43.781
"It's a deal," Jack said.

29
00:02:43.782 --> 00:02:50.508
Soon the man headed off with Milky White.

30
00:02:50.509 --> 00:02:56.520
And Jack headed home with five tiny beans.

